Significance: minor
Type: added

The Event Query Loop's controls can now be filtered rather than only added to. `gatherpress.eventQueryControls` and `gatherpress.eventInheritedQueryControls` hand you the list of controls the panel is about to render, as `{ name, Component, props }` entries, so a companion plugin can drop the ones its own layout has no use for, reorder them or insert its own. The control components are also published on `window.gatherpress.queryControls`, reached through the `gatherpress-query-controls` script handle or by importing `@gatherpress/query-controls`, for plugins that would rather compose a panel of their own.
